  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together olive oil, lemon juice, garlic, and a pinch of salt and pepper.",
    "Add the chicken to the marinade and mix well to coat.",
    "Let the chicken marinate for at least 30 minutes, or up to 2 hours in the refrigerator.",
    "Thread the chicken, cucumber, and bell pepper onto skewers.",
